The next major architectural modernization after you finish MoE well would probably be modern inference
infrastructure rather than immediately adding another exotic neural layer: paged KV cache, continuous
batching, quantization, speculative decoding, and eventually distributed expert parallelism.
That's where your current model starts turning from “modern architecture implementation” into
“modern serving system.”

